1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,100
Apply on the employer's portal. Auto Fill does the typing.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,893
Tap Apply on Portal.

3
00:00:06,193 --> 00:00:09,047
The employer's real form opens inside the app.

4
00:00:09,347 --> 00:00:11,722
Tap the robot, then Auto Fill.

5
00:00:12,022 --> 00:00:15,426
It scans the form, and fills it from your profile.

6
00:00:15,726 --> 00:00:18,726
Anything that needs you is flagged, not guessed.

7
00:00:19,026 --> 00:00:21,152
Your files attach themselves.

8
00:00:21,452 --> 00:00:23,459
The right regional version of each.

9
00:00:23,759 --> 00:00:25,468
Review, and submit.

10
00:00:25,768 --> 00:00:28,196
Logged as applied, on your dashboard.

11
00:00:28,496 --> 00:00:33,905
That is the whole loop. CVApplyr. Free to start, on iPhone and Android.

